# XNU patch series for Unisoc UMS512 / SharkL5Pro.
#
# The kernel source is xnu-10063.141.1 (the iPadOS 17.7.11 profile pins it).
# Two patches are needed on top of the UniXNU core series:
#
#   ums512-uart                  - polled SPRD UART console (0x70100000). Without
#                                  it the kernel enters and prints nothing at all,
#                                  because it has no console driver on this SoC.
#   ios-sweet-0011-physmap-alignment
#                                - reserve the PTOV twig padding for the sliding
#                                  physmap of the non-PPL (non-Apple) kernel.
#
# The reference first-boot tree hxzbaka/UniXNU-t610yp also carries
# ios-sweet-0001/0002/0005 and ums512-open-machine-layer; those are already part
# of xnu-10063 / the UniXNU core series (source-machine-layer.patch), so they are
# deliberately not repeated here.
ums512-uart.patch
ios-sweet-0011-physmap-alignment.patch